#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an instance {#update-an-instance}"
msgstr "Eine Instanz aktualisieren {#update-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`PATCH /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance) endpoint to update the limit, allocation, and permitted backends for an instance. The [CRN](/guides/instances) must be URL-encoded in the path.\n"
msgstr "Verwende den Endpunkt [`PATCH /v2/resource_instances/{crn}`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance), um das Limit, die Zuteilung und die zulässigen Backends einer Instanz zu aktualisieren. Die [CRN](/guides/instances) muss im Pfad URL-codiert sein.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pass a `parameters` JSON object in the request body with the fields you want to change, along with the header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`. Omitted fields are left unchanged.\n"
msgstr "Übergib im Anfragetext ein JSON-Objekt `parameters` mit den Feldern, die du ändern möchtest, zusammen mit dem Header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`. Ausgelassene Felder bleiben unverändert.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer, or `null`. The time allocated to this instance, used by the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) to determine queue priority. See [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits). Not applicable to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "`usage_allocation_seconds` — Integer oder `null`. Die dieser Instanz zugewiesene Zeit, die vom [Fair-Share-Scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler) genutzt wird, um die Priorität in der Warteschlange zu bestimmen. Siehe [Zuteilungslimits für Instanzen festlegen](/guides/allocation-limits). Gilt nicht für Pay-As-You-Go-Instanzen.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`backends` — Array of strings. The allowlist of backend names available to this instance. `[\"ANY\"]` means all backends on the plan are available. `[]` means no backends are available.\n"
msgstr "`backends` — Array von Strings. Die Erlaubnisliste der Backend-Namen, die für diese Instanz verfügbar sind. `[\"ANY\"]` bedeutet, dass alle Backends des Plans verfügbar sind. `[]` bedeutet, dass keine Backends verfügbar sind.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Always include a unique timestamp\">\n"
"  The API silently ignores the request if `parameters` is identical to the previous request. In the `parameters` object, always include a `timestamp` field set to the current time so each request is treated as unique.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Gib immer einen eindeutigen Zeitstempel an\">\n"
"  Die API ignoriert die Anfrage stillschweigend, wenn `parameters` mit der vorherigen Anfrage identisch ist. Füge im Objekt `parameters` immer ein Feld `timestamp` hinzu, das auf die aktuelle Zeit gesetzt ist, damit jede Anfrage als eindeutig behandelt wird.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The endpoint's response is similar to [getting an instance](#get-an-instance), including how it handles the `extensions` object.\n"
msgstr "Die Antwort des Endpunkts ähnelt der beim [Abrufen einer Instanz](#get-an-instance), einschließlich der Behandlung des Objekts `extensions`.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"    --request PATCH \\\n"
"    --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"    --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"    --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"    --data \"{\n"
"        \\\"parameters\\\": {\n"
"            \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"$(date -u +\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\\\",\n"
"            \\\"usage_allocation_seconds\\\": 220\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\"\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl \\\n"
"    --request PATCH \\\n"
"    --url 'https://resource-controller.cloud.ibm.com/v2/resource_instances/<YOUR_INSTANCE_CRN_URL_ENCODED>' \\\n"
"    --header 'Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"    --header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n"
"    --data \"{\n"
"        \\\"parameters\\\": {\n"
"            \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"$(date -u +\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\\\",\n"
"            \\\"usage_allocation_seconds\\\": 220\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\"\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import urllib.parse\n"
"    import datetime\n"
"    import requests\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import urllib.parse\n"
"    import datetime\n"
"    import requests\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    timestamp = datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\n"
"    body = {\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"    timestamp = datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\")\n"
"    body = {\n"
"        \"parameters\": {\n"
"            \"timestamp\": timestamp,\n"
"            \"usage_allocation_seconds\": 220,\n"
"        }\n"
"    }\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    resp = requests.patch(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    resp = requests.patch(\n"
"        url,\n"
"        headers={\n"
"            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\",\n"
"            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        json=body,\n"
"        timeout=30,\n"
"    )\n"
"    resp.raise_for_status()\n"
"    print(resp.json())\n"
"    ```\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new instance {#create-a-new-instance}"
msgstr "Eine neue Instanz erstellen {#create-a-new-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`POST /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance) endpoint to create (provision) a new instance. Pass a JSON body with the header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`.\n"
msgstr "Verwende den Endpunkt [`POST /v2/resource_instances`](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance), um eine neue Instanz zu erstellen (bereitzustellen). Übergib einen JSON-Text mit dem Header `\"Content-Type: application/json\"`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required fields:\n"
msgstr "Erforderliche Felder:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`name` — A human-readable name for the instance.\n"
msgstr "`name` — Ein für Menschen lesbarer Name für die Instanz.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`target` — The region, such as `us-east` or `eu-de`.\n"
msgstr "`target` — Die Region, z. B. `us-east` oder `eu-de`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`resource_plan_id` — The plan for this instance. See the [plan ID table](#get-a-list-of-all-instances).\n"
msgstr "`resource_plan_id` — Der Plan für diese Instanz. Siehe die [Tabelle der Plan-IDs](#get-a-list-of-all-instances).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`resource_group` — The [resource group](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs) to use.\n"
msgstr "`resource_group` — Die zu verwendende [Ressourcengruppe](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also include a `parameters` object to set quantum-specific values:\n"
msgstr "Du kannst auch ein Objekt `parameters` einfügen, um quantenspezifische Werte festzulegen:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
